  "sourceTitle": "Chocolate Marshmallow Square",
  "sourceText": "Chocolate Marshmallow Square\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 11:26pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup butter\n3/4 cup sugar\n2 eggs\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n1/4 teaspoon salt\n1 tablespoon cocoa\n1/4 teaspoon baking powder\n3/4 cup flour\n1/2 cup nuts\n2 cups mini marshmallows\n1 cup peanut butter\n1 cup chocolate chips\n2 cups Rice Krispies\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix together as a cake. Pour in greased pan. Bake 15 minutes. After baking, add marshmallows and return to oven for 3 minutes. 2 Melt together: 3 Add: 4 Spread on top. Bake at 350 degrees.",
